<title>CROATIA: Croatian PPI rises to 0.5 pct in Jan, 1.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian PPI rises to 0.5 pct in Jan, 1.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES	JANUARY     DEC '96    JAN '96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	    +0.5	  +0.3	 +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+1.8	  +1.5	 +1.9 NOTES</p>
<p>-- January producer prices rose 2.1 percent from the 1996 average. Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly producer price inflation was running at 29.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zoran Radosavljevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
